            "detailed_description": "EPIC FANTASY BATTLES<br />\r\nCommand valiant warriors and vicious demons in BattleLore: Command, based on the board game BattleLore Second Edition. Lead the noble Daqan army as they fearlessly defend their homeland from the invading hordes of the Uthuk Y’llan– demon-blooded barbarians spreading chaos and destruction wherever they go. Or, lead the Uthuk Y’llan and channel their fury into military supremacy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPREPARE FOR WAR: Muster armies suited to the mission at hand and support your strengths as a commander. Deploy them strategically and order them unit by unit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWIELD ARCANE POWERS: Lore powers give each army unique tactical and magical advantages you can use to surprise the enemy and turn the tide of battle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFIGHT A HEROIC CAMPAIGN: Take charge of the Daqan army in a multi-mission single-player campaign to vanquish the Uthuk Y’llan and save Terrinoth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMULTIPLAYER: Choose from multiple battlefields and game modes and play either the Daqan Lords or Uthuk Y’llan in battles against a friend or the computer in multiplayer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEXPAND YOUR GAME: Purchase the all-new LOCUST expansion to add even more units and battlefields to your game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYOU ARE IN COMMAND.",
            "about_the_game": "EPIC FANTASY BATTLES<br />\r\nCommand valiant warriors and vicious demons in BattleLore: Command, based on the board game BattleLore Second Edition. Lead the noble Daqan army as they fearlessly defend their homeland from the invading hordes of the Uthuk Y’llan– demon-blooded barbarians spreading chaos and destruction wherever they go. Or, lead the Uthuk Y’llan and channel their fury into military supremacy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPREPARE FOR WAR: Muster armies suited to the mission at hand and support your strengths as a commander. Deploy them strategically and order them unit by unit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWIELD ARCANE POWERS: Lore powers give each army unique tactical and magical advantages you can use to surprise the enemy and turn the tide of battle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFIGHT A HEROIC CAMPAIGN: Take charge of the Daqan army in a multi-mission single-player campaign to vanquish the Uthuk Y’llan and save Terrinoth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMULTIPLAYER: Choose from multiple battlefields and game modes and play either the Daqan Lords or Uthuk Y’llan in battles against a friend or the computer in multiplayer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEXPAND YOUR GAME: Purchase the all-new LOCUST expansion to add even more units and battlefields to your game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYOU ARE IN COMMAND.",
